# Dreadwing Scavenger's threshold is a static ability checked continuously (CR 207.2c, 611.3a): it is a 3/3 with deathtouch
# only "as long as" seven or more cards are in its controller's graveyard. On turn 1 Bot1 fills its graveyard to eight (Black
# Lotus, the Scavenger's loot, two Thought Scours on itself). On turn 2 Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles that graveyard, and the
# Scavenger is a 2/2 flier without deathtouch again at once.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Dreadwing Scavenger
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Island x30

